@startuml
title SIGMUN — Componentes

legend
SIGMUN
SIGMUN — Arquitetura Corporativa
Componentes — Mapa de componentes do código
Classificação da Informação: Pública
Responsável: Equipe SIGMUN
Status da revisão: Vigente
endlegend

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "src/core — núcleo compartilhado" {
  component "Aplicação (use cases e portas)" as C_application
  component "Domínio (entidades e regras)" as C_domain
  component "Infraestrutura (repositórios)" as C_infrastructure
  component "Apresentação (APIs e schemas)" as C_presentation
}

package "src/modules — domínios" {
  component "○ sigmun_administracao" as M_sigmun_administracao
  component "○ sigmun_agricultura" as M_sigmun_agricultura
  component "○ sigmun_almoxarifado" as M_sigmun_almoxarifado
  component "● sigmun_assistencia_social" as M_sigmun_assistencia_social
  component "● sigmun_cadastro" as M_sigmun_cadastro
  component "● sigmun_cadastro_imobiliario" as M_sigmun_cadastro_imobiliario
  component "● sigmun_compras" as M_sigmun_compras
  component "● sigmun_con" as M_sigmun_con
  component "○ sigmun_contabilidade" as M_sigmun_contabilidade
  component "○ sigmun_controladoria" as M_sigmun_controladoria
  component "● sigmun_dad" as M_sigmun_dad
  component "● sigmun_dia" as M_sigmun_dia
  component "● sigmun_educacao" as M_sigmun_educacao
  component "○ sigmun_financas" as M_sigmun_financas
  component "● sigmun_frotas" as M_sigmun_frotas
  component "○ sigmun_gabinete" as M_sigmun_gabinete
  component "● sigmun_gdo" as M_sigmun_gdo
  component "● sigmun_geoinformacao" as M_sigmun_geoinformacao
  component "● sigmun_idn" as M_sigmun_idn
  component "● sigmun_int" as M_sigmun_int
  component "○ sigmun_licitacoes" as M_sigmun_licitacoes
  component "● sigmun_met" as M_sigmun_met
  component "● sigmun_obras" as M_sigmun_obras
  component "● sigmun_orc" as M_sigmun_orc
  component "○ sigmun_ouvidoria" as M_sigmun_ouvidoria
  component "● sigmun_patrimonio" as M_sigmun_patrimonio
  component "○ sigmun_planejamento" as M_sigmun_planejamento
  component "○ sigmun_procuradoria" as M_sigmun_procuradoria
  component "● sigmun_rh" as M_sigmun_rh
  component "● sigmun_saude" as M_sigmun_saude
  component "● sigmun_seg" as M_sigmun_seg
  component "● sigmun_territorial" as M_sigmun_territorial
  component "○ sigmun_transparencia" as M_sigmun_transparencia
  component "● sigmun_tributos" as M_sigmun_tributos
}

package "src/shared — compartilhado" {
  component "Configuração e Celery" as S_config
  component "Constantes" as S_constants
  component "Exceções" as S_exceptions
  component "Middleware" as S_middleware
  component "Segurança" as S_security
  component "Tarefas assíncronas" as S_tasks
  component "Utilitários" as S_utils
}

package "Interfaces" {
  component "frontend/admin" as F_admin
  component "frontend/portal-cidadao" as F_cidadao
  component "frontend/portal-fornecedor" as F_fornecedor
  component "mobile/*" as MOB
}

package "Persistência e Infraestrutura" {
  component "alembic/versions" as MIG
  component "infra/docker" as IDOCKER
  component "infra/kubernetes" as IKUBE
  component "infra/terraform" as ITF
  component "docker-compose.yml" as COMPOSE
}

F_admin --> C_presentation : HTTP / REST
F_cidadao --> C_presentation : HTTP / REST
F_fornecedor --> C_presentation : HTTP / REST
MOB --> C_presentation : HTTP / REST

C_presentation --> C_application
C_application --> C_domain
C_infrastructure --> C_domain
C_infrastructure --> MIG

note right of C_presentation
As interfaces HTTP de todos os domínios
são registradas em src/main.py.
end note

note bottom of M_sigmun_territorial
● módulo com implementação identificada\n○ módulo preparado (scaffolding)
end note

note bottom of COMPOSE
Ambiente local com PostgreSQL 15, Redis 7,
backend, três frontends, worker, beat e flower.
end note

@enduml
